 "about": "Gen by Surface's sensor on the part (./?part=<id>: web/cad/onpart.js with no stage, the part in the generator's grey) for each sensor of a Library part without a scene (the UMI finger and its tapered tips), as tools/browser/library_shots.py shoots and encodes it: the three pictures' bytes and SHA-256, the fit and the build they are of, and the hash of the figure's sources they were pinned from (figure_sha256: a record only; the pictures are what is held).  Until 2026-11-12 the Library's own pictures of these sensors were these files byte for byte; since then the Library draws the part in its look (scenes/scenes.json's rules) and library_shots.py --check-generator holds Gen by Surface's figure to this pin.  Written by --pin-generator, only for a deliberate change of the figure or a sensor's new build.",
